  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_258131.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/tool-upgrades?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/258131(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hmaD7Se\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"400\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 Описание\n\nЭтот мод добавляет новый способ зачарования вашего снаряжения, создание паст из различных материалов и их нанесение на модификаторы для присвоения им конкретных чар!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 Обзор\n\n![блоки и предметы](https://i.imgur.com/iJOD4mW.png)\n\n![модификатор](https://i.imgur.com/xF6WV0q.png)\n\n![крафт улучшений](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/DE7bjCuH/images/a6c803540ac2f15ebb79d1226ba240e49ddbcb5e.png)\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/aNBxukTArbA\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/6ckT-5_tp8k\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ Зависимости\n\n### Обязательные:\n- **Magma Core**\n  - Предоставляет базовый код и функции, такие как проверка обновлений \n  - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n### Поддерживаемые:\n- **Just Enough Items (JEI)**\n  - Предоставляет дополнительные страницы с информацией и отображает все рецепты\n  - [CurseForge][cf_jei] | [Modrinth][mr_jei]\n- **MoreMcmeta Emissive Textures**\n  - Включает эмиссивные текстуры мода\n  - [CurseForge][cf_mcmeta] | [Modrinth][mr_mcmeta]\n- **Continuity**\n  - Включает эмиссивные текстуры мода\n  - [CurseForge][cf_continuity] | [Modrinth][mr_continuity]\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 Мои другие моды!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные структуры\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Шахтёр бедрока\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Улучшение инструментов\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Вся совместимость\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Кастомизированный лут подземелий\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Продвинутые инструменты\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"Эпоха оружия\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Рунное ремесло\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Коллекционные предметы\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные драгоценности\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ловушки для шахт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Экзокрафт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Городское строительство\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Переработка\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Лексикон\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Режим битвы Nexus\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Детектив блоков\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Подозрительные горшки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"сообщение\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexR